      "notes": "From 1ddc3e9 the runtime applies firmware-telemetry/v2's Device Mode rules to every manifest it registers or holds: it refuses a device_mode outside the four v2 defines or other than the mode its channels and actions determine (invalid_device_mode), and a manifest with no channel (no_channels). v1 accepts both shapes, so this is a deliberate stricter acceptance, not an assessed divergence; the empty-channels refusal predates it. The runtime made the change while keeping its version, on the maintainer's ruling that a release version does not justify accepting a misleading manifest."
